1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,270
The gear on the chart opens Chart Settings.

2
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:08,930
Appearance sets the chart colours: background, grid, and the up and down candles.

3
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:16,860
Click a colour box to open the palette, then pick a colour.

4
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:23,170
You can also type a colour code and press OK.

5
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:29,430
Status Line chooses what shows next to the instrument name.

6
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:35,110
Scales turns the Bid and Ask price lines on or off, and the candle countdown.

7
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:43,800
Canvas sets the grid lines and an optional watermark.

8
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:47,890
Trading controls how your trades are drawn on the chart.

9
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:51,050
Save keeps these settings as a template. Templates puts one back.

10
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:53,710
Tick Apply to all charts to change every chart at once.

11
00:00:53,810 --> 00:00:59,760
Reset to Defaults goes back to the standard settings. Close the window with the X.

